  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Internally Displaced Persons and Vulnerable Mobile Populations in Cameroon&apos;s Centre and East Regions Through Assessments and Access to Legal Identity Solutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will be implemented in the Centre and East regions of Cameroon with the following global objective. The needs of internally displaced persons and vulnerable mobile populations in Cameroon&#x2019;s Centre and East regions are further supported, through support for the provision of legal identity documents, as well as further assessments of the needs and dynamics of mobility to facilitate further support from other actors.</narrative>
  </description>
